		<itunes:summary><![CDATA[<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/silviaattanasio/">Silvia Attanasio</a>, is the Head of Innovation at <a href="https://www.abi.it/Pagine/default.aspx">ABI (Italian Banking Association)</a>. Previously to that role she worked for 17 years at <a href="https://www.abilab.it/home">ABI Labs</a>, the centre of research and innovation at ABI. Previously Silvia introduced us to Spunta, the private permissioned DLT project for interbank reconciliation. In this podcast she shares with us some of the work that ABI and its consortium of Italian Banks are looking to offer to the European Central Bank in its development of its CBDC called the Digital Euro.<br />
